[OC]|cffffcc00Check:|r log should hold nothing from Powderfuse Port but Friz's errands. Handed in here: Clear 'em Out (95792), Proof of Profit (95934, unless abandoned at Scaldaron), Terrors From the Deep (95260), Saltwater Savages (95118), Unfriendly Competition (95119), Unchecked Expansion (95122), A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs! (95123), See Ya, Scallywags! (95165), Admiral Lamora (95124), WANTED: Trapclaw (95254), Gaseous Gold (96063), Rock 'em and Sock 'em (96067), A Few Furs for Friz (94928), Smuggler's Paradise, Smuggler's Special and Smuggler's Bargain (95288, 95293, 95294); if taken, A Taste of the Sea (95121). Carried out: I Know a Guy (95295, Booty Bay, chapter 45), From Port to Port (95219, Feathermoon, chapter 47) and, if taken, Shipping and Handling (95296, Tanaris, chapter 46). Quest money this chapter: 2g 25s
